gs": {}, "id": 129, "type": "CreateVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CreateVideo"}, "order": 17, "widgets_values_named": {"codec": "none", "fps": 24, "chroma_subsampling": "auto", "bit_depth": 8, "color_space": "sRGB"}}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax H3\n\n[MiniMax H3](https://www.minimax.io/blog/minimax-h3) 是 MiniMax 的通用全模态生成模型。它能联合理解文本、图像、视频和音频，并生成带有**原生立体声音频**的视频：语音、音效和音乐在单次前向传播中联合建模，而非事后叠加。输出最高可达 2K 分辨率、24fps，时长最长约 15 秒。\n\nH3 消除了生成模式之间常见的任务边界。文本生视频、图像生视频、首/尾帧控制以及参考驱动生成（角色、运动、镜头、语音、风格）全部由一个模型处理，而非各自独立的专家流水线。\n\n## 关于此工作流\n\n此模板运行纯**文本生视频（t2va）**：`MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` 节点未连接 `first_frame` / `last_frame`，因此生成仅由提示词驱动。同一节点也接受可选的关键帧；将图像接入 `first_frame` 和/或 `last_frame` 即可将其变为首/尾帧图像生视频（fl2va），而无需更改图中的其他任何内容。\n\n**关键输入**\n\n- **prompt**：在一个区块中描述镜头、运镜以及伴随的音频（对话、音效、音乐）\n- **width / height**：通过 Resolution Selector 设置。H3 的原生画布短边为 768px，上限为 768x1344 像素，并取整为 32 的倍数\n- **duration (seconds)**：由 Math Expression 节点转换为有效的帧 `length`，在 24fps 下向上对齐到模型每块 17 帧（17k+5）的网格"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax H3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [440.546875, 627.453125], "pos": [-3034.8291015625, 4787.09716796875], "id": 116, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## MiniMax H3\n\n[MiniMax H3](https://www.minimax.io/blog/minimax-h3) 是 MiniMax 的通用全模态生成模型。它能联合理解文本、图像、视频和音频，并生成带有**原生立体声音频**的视频：语音、音效和音乐在单次前向传播中联合建模，而非事后叠加。输出最高可达 2K 分辨率、24fps，时长最长约 15 秒。\n\nH3 消除了生成模式之间常见的任务边界。文本生视频、图像生视频、首/尾帧控制以及参考驱动生成（角色、运动、镜头、语音、风格）全部由一个模型处理，而非各自独立的专家流水线。\n\n## 关于此工作流\n\n此模板运行纯**文本生视频（t2va）**：`MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` 节点未连接 `first_frame` / `last_frame`，因此生成仅由提示词驱动。同一节点也接受可选的关键帧；将图像接入 `first_frame` 和/或 `last_frame` 即可将其变为首/尾帧图像生视频（fl2va），而无需更改图中的其他任何内容。\n\n**关键输入**\n\n- **prompt**：在一个区块中描述镜头、运镜以及伴随的音频（对话、音效、音乐）\n- **width / height**：通过 Resolution Selector 设置。H3 的原生画布短边为 768px，上限为 768x1344 像素，并取整为 32 的倍数\n- **duration (seconds)**：由 Math Expression 节点转换为有效的帧 `length`，在 24fps 下向上对齐到模型每块 17 帧（17k+5）的网格"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}, {"name": "INT", "links": [242], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "INT"}, {"name": "BOOL", "links": [], "label": "BOOL", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "BOOL"}], "size": [360, 160], "pos": [-2017.2137894832676, 5156.095576439778], "widgets_values": ["max(5, round(a * 24)) + (5 - (max(5, round(a * 24)) % 17)) % 17"], "inputs": [{"name": "values.a", "link": 245, "label": "values.a", "type": "FLOAT,INT,BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "a"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "values.b", "label": "values.b", "type": "FLOAT,INT,BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "b"}, {"widget": {"name": "expression"}, "name": "expression", "label": "expression", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "expression"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 131, "type": "ComfyMathExpression", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfyMathExpression"}, "order": 10, "widgets_values_named": {"expression": "max(5, round(a * 24)) + (5 - (max(5, round(a * 24)) % 17)) % 17"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [239], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [640, 120], "pos": [-2531.9996062241407, 4065.4658033557425], "widgets_values": ["qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors", "minimax", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clip_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "type"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}], "flags": {}, "id": 127, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"direc